# CAF Free PHP / Woo / Release

## Normalize / sanitize (Free-owned)

- MUST keep Free normalize → tier filters, single-instance, all `caf_sanitize_free_*`, preview sanitize, gradient flatten.
- NEVER replace this file with Pro’s thinner normalize.
- WHEN porting a Pro normalize improvement: merge into Free; keep Free enforcement.
- Public AJAX (`caf_builder_harden_public_ajax_query_args` / `caf_builder_clamp_public_ajax_args_for_tier`): Free must allowlist meta keys (`_price`) and ignore client Pro sorting — do not rely on JS gates alone.

## Woo

- MUST extend only `CAF_Free_Woo` for Free Woo needs.
- Allowlisted sync source lives in Pro `scripts/free-plugin/` — Free WP.org patches to that file must be ported back there before next sync.

## Dist

- Release `.distignore`: build only (no src/maps/node_modules).
- Debug `.distignore-debug`: may keep src + maps; still no node_modules.
- Keep readme Source Code links when shipping minified JS.

## Post–WP.org patch checklist

1. Is this file Free-owned or sync-allowlisted?
2. Free-owned → edit Free only.
3. Allowlisted → edit Free for urgency **and** Pro `free-plugin/` for durability.
